      "UIHeader": {
        "id": "UIHeader",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "# Two-variable arithmetic-geometric mean inequality\n\n**Assumptions**\n\n- $a,b$ are nonnegative real numbers.\n\n**Statement / basic definitions**\n\n$$\n\\forall a,b\\in[0,\\infty),\\quad\\frac{a+b}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{ab}\n$$\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/index|Overview and background]] · Proved (mathematical conclusion)",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "A1": {
        "id": "A1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| A1 | ASSUMPTION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Nonnegative inputs\n\n$$\na,b\\in[0,\\infty)\n$$\n\nAssume $a,b\\ge0$.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/A1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/A1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/A1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "K1": {
        "id": "K1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| K1 | KNOWN_RESULT |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Square nonnegativity\n\n$$\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R,\\quad t^2\\ge0\n$$\n\nEvery real square is nonnegative.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/K1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "C1": {
        "id": "C1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "**C1**\n\nCOMBINE\n\nMerge\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/C1|Details]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "R1": {
        "id": "R1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| R1 | BOUND |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Squared comparison\n\n$$\n(a+b)^2\\ge 4ab\n$$\n\nThe squared arithmetic sum bounds the product.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/R1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/R1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/R1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "K2": {
        "id": "K2",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| K2 | KNOWN_RESULT |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Square-root monotonicity\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\forall u,v\\in[0,\\infty),\\\\&\\quad u\\le v\\\\&\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\sqrt u\\le\\sqrt v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSquare roots preserve order on nonnegative reals.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/K2|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K2#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K2#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "C2": {
        "id": "C2",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "**C2**\n\nCOMBINE\n\nMerge\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/C2|Details]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "T1": {
        "id": "T1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| T1 | TARGET |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Arithmetic-geometric mean\n\n$$\n\\frac{a+b}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{ab}\n$$\n\nThe arithmetic mean is at least the geometric mean.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/T1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/T1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/T1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      }
    },
